  "details": "When sitting/lounging and the waist tracker is at a certain angle the spine will extend about 3/4 of an inch. You can pivot the tracker vertically while sitting to reproduce the issue. The main thing you notice is your hip moving up and down instantly. It's not a smooth transition. It's also not local issue because my friends can see it happening to. Originally I thought is was my waist tracker being weird, but when I open the steam VR overlay, the tracker is not moving but my avatar is.",
